"explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":74,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"以下代码的输出将是什么？\n\n```python\nclass LinkedList:\n  def __init__(self):\n    self.head = None\n\n  def append(self, data):\n    new_node = Node(data)\n    last_node = self.head\n    while last_node.next:\n      last_node = last_node.next\n    last_node.next = new_node\n  \n  llist = LinkedList()\n  llist.append(\"A\")\n  llist.append(\"B\")\n  llist.print_list()  \n```","question_text_html":"<p>以下代码的输出将是什么？</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">class LinkedList:\n  def __init__(self):\n    self.head = None\n\n  def append(self, data):\n    new_node = Node(data)\n    last_node = self.head\n    while last_node.next:\n      last_node = last_node.next\n    last_node.next = new_node\n  \n  llist = LinkedList()\n  llist.append(&quot;A&quot;)\n  llist.append(&quot;B&quot;)\n  llist.print_list()  \n</code></pre>\n","question_options":[{"text":"A B\n","text_html":"<p>A B</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"A\n","text_html":"<p>A</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"没有输出","text_html":"<p>没有输出</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"运行错误","text_html":"<p>运行错误</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"`self.head`最初是`None`。当`self.head`为`None`时，`append`方法不处理这种情况。","md_html":"<p><code>self.head</code>最初是<code>None</code>。当<code>self.head</code>为<code>None</code>时，<code>append</code>方法不处理这种情况。</p>\n"},"correct":true}]},{"question_id":75,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"对于一个包含$n$元素的单链表，在你可以访问头部节点的情况下，删除头部节点的时间复杂度是多少？","question_text_html":"<p>对于一个包含<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"stru